12. Introducing Snyk

	Snyk is another security platform that can scan multiple areas of an application.

It can be used for:

	Open Source Dependencies
	        ↓
		   SCA
		   	|
	Container Images
	        ↓
	Container Security

	Terraform / Kubernetes / IaC
	        ↓
	Infrastructure Security ----> wiz code scanning tool 

	Source Code  
	        ↓
	Security Analysis


A simplified view:


                 SNYK
                   │
       ┌───────────┼───────────┐
       │           │           │
       ▼           ▼           ▼
   Dependencies  Container     IaC
       │           │           │
       ▼           ▼           ▼
      SCA       Docker       Terraform


