13. Snyk Dependency Scan

	For a Python project, Snyk can identify vulnerable dependencies.

Example:

	snyk test

	For a requirements file:

	snyk test --file=requirements.txt


------------------------------------------------------------------

14. Snyk Container Scan

	Build the image:

		docker build -t myapp:latest .


	Then:

		snyk container test myapp:latest

	This checks the container image for vulnerabilities.


----------------------------------------------------------------------

15. Snyk IaC Scan

For Terraform:

	snyk iac test .

